---
# Permissive on purpose — see .gitea/workflows/ci.yml for why. This repo is a
# large, pre-existing codebase (see AGENTS.md); `min` is ansible-lint's
# smallest profile (only what ansible-lint needs to run at all), chosen
# deliberately so CI gives a real green/red signal today instead of a wall
# of pre-existing findings. Tighten the profile (basic -> moderate -> ...)
# as a follow-up, not as part of standing this up.
profile: min

exclude_paths:
  # Retired v2 roles/playbooks, reference only — predates this repo's own
  # conventions and is not touched by ongoing work (see AGENTS.md, "do not
  # restore without going through docs/plan/migration.md first").
  - archive/
  # ansible-galaxy installs collections and roles here when ansible-lint runs.
  # It is third-party source, gitignored, and never ours to lint — without this
  # ansible-lint walks into it and reports other people's findings as ours.
  - .ansible/
